      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Reece from Northern Energy Electrical Solutions (Townsville) was prompt to contact me and send a quote.  I explained I wanted a hybrid system and to have a EV charger included in the quote.Installation took a couple of days due to some staffing issues which is understandable given the shortage in tradesmen at the moment.  The install looks very professional, neat and tidy, my neighbours have even complimented us on how good the system looks.I opted to go for Sungrow inverters with Jinko Tiger Neo solar panels.  Once install was completed Reece ran through the isolarcloud app with me and it was all up and running.  I'm just a bit addicted to checking the app and how much solar we are producing and couldn't be happier with choosing Northern Energy Electrical Solutions to do the job.",
